A '''Separatist outpost''' formed from a pair of [[XT Beetle Transport]]s was located on the [[planet]] [[Orto Plutonia]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. The [[B1-series battle droid]]s of this outpost disturbed the native [[Talz]], so the Talz eventually [[Skirmish on Orto Plutonia|destroyed]] all of them, then posted their heads on spears at the entrance of the transport.<ref name="Trespass" />

